							"additionalProperties": false,
							"description": "The three mandatory French legal notices to embed in the e-invoice.\nOnly allowed when `convert_to_e_invoice` is `true` — sending this field\nwithout conversion enabled is an error. When provided, it takes priority over\nthe legal notices configured in the footer of your Pennylane account.\n",
